sequence A protected route rejects a request
// From: fastapi/security/oauth2.py:401-421,536-543, fastapi/dependencies/utils.py:694-756, fastapi/applications.py:1000, fastapi/exception_handlers.py:11-17, docs_src/security/tutorial004.py:53
Client -GET without an Authorization header-> request handler
request handler -solve_dependencies-> solve_dependencies
note right of solve_dependencies
  The route depends on an OAuth2PasswordBearer instance (docs_src/security/tutorial004.py:53).
solve_dependencies -await call(request)-> OAuth2PasswordBearer
note right of OAuth2PasswordBearer
  Instances are async callables: __call__ at security/oauth2.py:536. solve_dependencies awaits it at dependencies/utils.py:750.
OAuth2PasswordBearer -reads the Authorization header-> OAuth2PasswordBearer
if no header or the scheme is not bearer
  OAuth2PasswordBearer -auto_error is true: raise make_not_authenticated_error-> ExceptionMiddleware
  note right of OAuth2PasswordBearer
    security/oauth2.py:401-421 builds HTTPException with status 401, detail Not authenticated and header WWW-Authenticate: Bearer.
  ExceptionMiddleware -http_exception_handler-> Client
  note right of ExceptionMiddleware
    Registered by default at applications.py:1000; exception_handlers.py:11 returns a JSON body with the detail.
else
  OAuth2PasswordBearer -returns the token-> solve_dependencies
  solve_dependencies -passes token to the endpoint-> Path operation function
